{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:741dbeae68b96924","name":"Plasma Bridge","source":{"id":"source:reference-741dbeae68b96924","title":"Plasma Bridge","revision":20921,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:48:26Z","sha256":"3b8101365cee9cadc2936c57ec3bcb4b005a9b34e18fe742919d6669b5a46d41","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20921","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Plasma%20Bridge&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-741dbeae68b96924","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 12,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 700 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Plasma Bridge is projected from a single plasma generator, creating a surface 6 squares wide and up to 120 squares long. It can be used to bridge gaps or bypass terrain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hazards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hazards"}," (such as bodies of water or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acid Pools"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acid_Pools"},"). The Plasma Bridge must be hooked up to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"}," in order to function. If an active Plasma Bridge is deactivated, of if its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"}," is destroyed or disconnected, the Plasma Bridge generator stores enough energy to power the bridge for 2 rounds. After 2 rounds, if the Plasma Bridge is not reactivated or reconnected to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"},", the bridge vanishes, and any character or anything on the bridge begins to fall.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
